2. Live server offers websocket upgrade; socket emits "upgrade" with transport "websocket".
3. Socket is closed.
4. Second socket is created with explicit option `{ rememberUpgrade: false }`.
5. Verifies immediately that socket2.transport.name is NOT "websocket".
